# Build context hygiene. node_modules (422 MB) is reinstalled from the lockfile
# in the deps stage, and .next (113 MB) is rebuilt in the builder stage — both
# are pure upload cost, and a stale .next carried into the image is exactly the
# class of problem behind DL-034.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
